# Mirror of the mock_ preview art of PLAYABLE preview cards, derived by
# SWUSim/DevTools/sync-preview-images.php from the TRACKED WebpImages/mock_*.webp. Pure duplication of
# bytes already in git, and it grows with every preview, so it is generated rather than committed —
# re-run the sync after deploy (see the swusim-sync-preview-images skill) or the Previews page is empty.
SWUSim/PreviewsImplemented/
SWUSim/Tests/Snapshots/
SWUSim/docs/test-gaps/
